      { title: 'Protect work information', learn: 'Check the organization\'s approved tools, data classifications, and sharing rules before submitting information. Avoid sensitive information in an unapproved system.', prompt: 'Create a fictional pre-use checklist covering permissions, data sensitivity, and output review.', practice: 'Identify two fictional information types that require additional approval.', check: 'Does removing a person\'s name always make a document safe to share?', answer: 'No. Other information can still be sensitive or identify someone.' }
